config MESON_SMARTCARD
	tristate "Amlogic ISO 7816 smart card interface"
	depends on ARCH_MESON || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Support for the ISO 7816 smart card interface of the Amlogic GXBB,
	  GXL, GXM, G12A, G12B and SM1 SoCs, used with the card slot of
	  DVB receivers. The card is accessed through /dev/smcN with the
	  interface of the Amlogic vendor driver, as used by OSCam.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called meson-smartcard.
